# The Dockerfile copies only devkit_ws/src, raceline, tools, ros_env.sh and the
# multi-track params/scripts; everything else stays out of the build context.
# An un-ignore only takes effect if every parent directory is un-ignored too,
# which is why experiments/ and experiments/iros2026 are listed before the
# two leaves; the 86 MB of run artefacts beside them stay excluded.
*
!devkit_ws/src
!raceline
!tools
!ros_env.sh
!docker/entrypoint.sh
!experiments
experiments/*
!experiments/iros2026
experiments/iros2026/*
!experiments/iros2026/params
!experiments/iros2026/scripts

# colcon artefacts and caches inside the copied directories
**/build/
**/install/
**/log/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.egg-info/
tools/libnodelay.so
